			   CALCULATED="Y"
			   CALCULATED_VALUE="IIF(((InList(LookupName(&quot;VHA_FUNCTION_ACCESS_RESP&quot;, &quot;Resp|AcessoryfulTBUI&quot;),GetProfileAttrAsList(&quot;User Responsibilities&quot;))) AND [VF Stock Indicator Calc TBUI] = &quot;Y&quot;), &quot;N&quot;, &quot;Y&quot;)"
			   COMMENTS="GT Phase2 - 23/03/2016 - Rinu - Modified the calculated Field value from - IIF(((InvokeServiceMethod(&quot;VF Check Responsibilities&quot;,&quot;Check Responsibilities&quot;,&quot;Responsibility=VF Function Access - Accessory-Def Fulfilment-TBUI&quot;,&quot;Exists&quot;) = &quot;Y&quot;) AND [VF Stock Indicator Calc TBUI] = &quot;Y&quot;), &quot;N&quot;, &quot;Y&quot;)

Neel - QC1718 - if Device is in stock, then Accessories should NOT be added - we don&apos;t want to allow customers to select deferred accessories when device is in stock.
VF:Roseline 23/08/2014 - Created for adding accessory based on the responsibility in TBUI Upgrade Postpaid flow"
